asset:        ic_launcher.png
title:        PhotoCraft app icon, Android mipmap-hdpi (72x72)
author:       PhotoCraft contributors (ArtCraft brand mark, see docs/brand/LICENSE-brand.txt)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0 (code and assets); the ArtCraft mark is a trademark, docs/brand/LICENSE-brand.txt
license-file: assets/app-icon/LICENSE.txt
added:        2026-10-17 by PhotoCraft contributors (Android launcher icon)
notes:        Launcher icon for the Android build, in the resource tree cargo apk passes to
              aapt -S. The sidecar is dot-prefixed because aapt rejects a second resource name
              per directory but skips dot files (see packaging/icons.sh). Resized from the
              committed hicolor 512 px render of photocraft.svg (the tight full-bleed variant)
              with Lanczos resampling; packaging/icons.sh regenerates every density from the
              vector.
